---
title: Winter trail care, one track at a time
date: 2026-09-18
draft: true
---

A brief update from the trail crew and the shared work behind winter miles.

Grooming is only the visible part. Before the first snow there is brush to cut
back, bridges to check, and drainage to clear so that a thaw does not take the
tread with it.

If you want to help, volunteer days are announced on Facebook.
